  panel: {fileID: 0}
  bodyText: {fileID: 0}
  reopenKey: 104
  manualText: 'HOW TO PLAY


    BLUE = SAFE. Enemies cannot hurt you inside blue zones.

    RED = CURSED. Red zones damage you. Stay out of them.

    CRYSTALS: collect them to complete the level''s goal.

    POWER ENERGY: powers your magic. Use it wisely.

    GATE: opens when you finish the level''s goal.


    Press H to open this guide again.'
